{"3698900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steal Out", "steam_appid": 3698900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Best Thief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun, competitive game, you’ll become a daring thief ready to do anything for the ultimate score. With valuables under tight guard, time running out, and rivals scheming against you, show the city who’s the greatest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Modes, Endless Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into heists and game modes galore. Master every challenge or escape the chaos with your head held high—if you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealing is a Blast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or strangers: push, shoot, explode, sabotage, destroy, and hide. Rack up points to claim the champion’s crown, but remember—it’s the chaos along the way that counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style is Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says thieves need masks and black outfits? Pull off heists in a koala suit, alien gear, coconut shell… or just a paper bag. This city’s never seen style like yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Solo or Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a dream team of four or fly solo. Pull off brilliant (or hilariously messy) heists to dominate the thieves’ championship and climb the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Events in this game are 100% authentic. That’s how I operate.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– Self-proclaimed “World’s Greatest Thief”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The best game ever! My son plays it non-stop!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– Mom of one of the devs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Please stop poking the round trap. Seriously.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– A tired tester</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Best Thief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun, competitive game, you’ll become a daring thief ready to do anything for the ultimate score. With valuables under tight guard, time running out, and rivals scheming against you, show the city who’s the greatest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Modes, Endless Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into heists and game modes galore. Master every challenge or escape the chaos with your head held high—if you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealing is a Blast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or strangers: push, shoot, explode, sabotage, destroy, and hide. Rack up points to claim the champion’s crown, but remember—it’s the chaos along the way that counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style is Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says thieves need masks and black outfits? Pull off heists in a koala suit, alien gear, coconut shell… or just a paper bag. This city’s never seen style like yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Solo or Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a dream team of four or fly solo. Pull off brilliant (or hilariously messy) heists to dominate the thieves’ championship and climb the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.poster.avif?t=1786365641\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.webm?t=1786365641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Events in this game are 100% authentic. That’s how I operate.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– Self-proclaimed “World’s Greatest Thief”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The best game ever! My son plays it non-stop!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– Mom of one of the devs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Please stop poking the round trap. Seriously.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>– A tired tester</strong></p>", "short_description": "In this chaotic, laugh-out-loud, and competitive game for up to 4 players, you’ll pull off an epic heist and escape before you’re caught! Dive into wild fun with your friends — avoid traps, crack safes, and steal loot. And most importantly, have a great time!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/070d1012c1f9d042ea038894f172db2a121eaab8/header.jpg?t=1786365641", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/6ab372452effa1d39d3baea78be6b0d96265d5ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786365641", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/6ab372452